- New test `vector-head-rules-are-stratified-too` covers a vector self-negating rule and a vector mutual one. `query_rules_test` is now 22 tests, 63 assertions.
- New corpus case `rules.recursion-through-negation-vector-head`, a refusal. The corpus has 113 cases (56 executable, 9 difference, 19 refusal, 29 pending). The new BLAKE3 is `51e02181…128c`, updated in the conformance test pin, `provenance.edn` and the README totals.

